1.12.2: release.sh --restage - deploy film changes without a release

The self-completing catalog stages at release time only, but the film
library changes independently of source (fetch_luts.sh --rawtherapee
being the canonical case), and re-releasing an existing version is
rightly refused. release.sh --restage redeploys gh-pages from the
current repo state - fresh staging included - touching neither main
nor tags. The two-step "convert the collection, put it on the page"
becomes: fetch --rawtherapee, release.sh --restage.
